{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《女神配對計劃2》昨晚（13日）播出的第二集瞬間引爆全網淚腺。在一眾求愛勇者當中，最令人震驚兼感動的環節，絕對是郭珮文（Juliana）相戀近4年的前度俞鋆瑞（Ice）突發登場。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5aaf7ca4-4aab-4228-a97b-f1574c0a0d4b.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026XdYuHDUORf1789355797.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5aaf7ca4-4aab-4228-a97b-f1574c0a0d4b.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ice 為了挽回舊愛，竟然不惜「飛半個地球」驚喜現身，並當眾向 Juliana 深情表白：「在你和你分手後到今天，我一直都很想念你。其實我一直都想和你一起完成我們未完的故事。I hope you remember me.（我希望你還記得我。）」這番只為她一人而來的癡情剖白，瞬間令全場感動催淚。面對如此霸氣又深情的舉動，Ice 最終毫無懸念地獲得眾女神一致撳燈力撐，Juliana 更親手為對方戴上頸鏈，場面極度 Sweet。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"julianakpm_1789308479_3985329724829867485_1400115974.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026RXZZdUHNpF1789355798.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"julianakpm_1789308479_3985329724829867485_1400115974.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">節目播出後，一直予人性格內斂印象的 Juliana 罕有地在社交網發表長文，坦露參演以來的脆弱心聲。她自認不擅長表達，起初曾懷疑自己是否適合真人騷舞台：「很多脆弱的情緒都放在心裏，有時候內心起伏很大，說出來的話卻平平淡淡。」但為了尋找對的人，她依然選擇勇敢嘗試。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">對於前度驚喜赴約，她坦言是一個「格外意外的驚喜」，並預告接下來會與其他求愛勇者慢慢相處。她期望透過這次經歷，學會更坦然地表達內心想法：「理清自己對感情的期待，在一切未知裏完成自我成長。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"julianakpm_1789308479_3985329717666082762_1400115974.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026nWfJ7Glqev1789355798.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"julianakpm_1789308479_3985329717666082762_1400115974.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">這幕重逢畫面播出後，大批網民紛紛湧入留言區大呼感動：「呢幕太催淚」、「會唔會咁Sweet」！同場的女神好姊妹亦被深深打動，阮嘉敏激動留言大叫：「你哋一定要一齊返呀！！！！😭😭😭😭以後都唔可以再分開」，而陳若思亦表示：「So sweet 被感動到了」。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8815b5b0-11d0-4209-8da6-89469db0f947.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026HoohhzOPse1789355798.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8815b5b0-11d0-4209-8da6-89469db0f947.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"julianakpm_1789308479_3985329717666082762_1400115974.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026nWfJ7Glqev1789355798.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"julianakpm_1789308479_3985329717666082762_1400115974.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:52.944159+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":655,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}